X:1
T:Sing, O Sing, This Blessed Morn
T:NATIVITY
C:Music: William Henry Monk, 1865 · Words: Christopher Wordsworth, 1865
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: Music and lyrics from "The Holy Year", 1865 by Christopher Wordsworth Hymn 10 page 18. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/nativity_lahee) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
